<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Veeco downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Veeco downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Veeco Instruments Inc to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said maintained the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Veeco lost 1-7/8 to 32-1/4.</p>
</text>
